{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "先把所有数字放入哈希集合，去重后即可用 O(1) 的平均时间判断某个数字是否存在。只有当 x−1 不在集合中时，x 才可能是连续序列的起点，再从它向右逐个扩展。示例中 1 是起点并扩展到 4，得到最长长度 4；每个数字只参与常数次判断，整体时间复杂度为 O(n)。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>最长连续序列可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\n.wrap{width:100%;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px;display:block}\n.lc-explain-content.consecutive-explain{padding:8px!important}\n.heading{margin-bottom:10px}.title{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#e2e5e8}.sub{color:#9aa1a9;font-size:11px;margin-top:3px}\n.mono,.num,.length-value{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.section-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;margin-bottom:6px;color:#c6cbd0;font-size:11px}.muted{color:#9aa1a9}\n.set{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.num{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-width:42px;min-height:32px;padding:5px 8px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#282a2c;color:#c6cbd0;font-size:13px;transition:background-color 250ms ease-out,border-color 250ms ease-out,color 250ms ease-out,opacity 250ms ease-out}\n.num.confirmed{background:#21303d;border-color:#40576c;color:#cbd7e2}.num.origin{border-color:#8ab9e5;box-shadow:inset 0 -2px #8ab9e5}.num.endpoint{background:#0e639c;border-color:#79b8ff;color:#fff}.num.scan{border-color:#79b8ff;color:#e9f3ff}\n.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:6px;color:#9aa1a9;font-size:10px}.legend span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px}.legend i{width:10px;height:10px;border:1px solid #40576c;border-radius:2px;background:#21303d}.legend .origin-key{border-color:#8ab9e5;box-shadow:inset 0 -2px #8ab9e5}.legend .endpoint-key{background:#0e639c;border-color:#79b8ff}\n.sequence-section{border-top:1px solid #373a3d;border-bottom:1px solid #373a3d;margin:10px 0;padding:10px 0}\n.sequence{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;min-height:32px}.sequence-item{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;flex-shrink:0}.sequence-item.entering{animation:sequence-enter 250ms ease-out both}.arrow{color:#8094a7;font-size:12px}.empty{color:#9aa1a9;font-size:11px;min-height:32px;display:flex;align-items:center}\n@keyframes sequence-enter{from{opacity:0;transform:translateX(-4px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateX(0)}}\n.bar{height:3px;background:#34383c;border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:8px}.fill{height:100%;width:0;background:#3794ff;transition:width 250ms ease-out}\n.lengths{display:flex;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:18px;margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;color:#9aa1a9}.length-value{display:inline-block;margin-left:4px;color:#e2e5e8;font-size:15px;font-weight:600}.best-summary{margin-top:4px;font-size:11px;color:#9aa1a9}.best-summary .mono{color:#cbd7e2}\n.scan-line{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;font-size:11px;color:#c6cbd0}.step-count{color:#9aa1a9;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:10px}.status{margin:4px 0 0;min-height:36px;line-height:1.5;font-size:12px;color:#e2e5e8}.hint{margin-top:6px;color:#9aa1a9;font-size:11px;line-height:1.5}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.num,.fill{transition:none}.sequence-item.entering{animation:none}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"wrap consecutive-explain\">\n<header class=\"heading\"><div class=\"title\">最长连续序列</div><div class=\"sub\">只从没有前驱的数字开始扩展.</div><div class=\"sub mono\">nums = [100, 4, 200, 1, 3, 2]</div></header>\n<section><div class=\"section-heading\"><span>哈希集合</span><span class=\"muted\">保留输入顺序展示</span></div><div class=\"set\" id=\"set\"></div><div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"origin-key\"></i>起点 x</span><span><i></i>已确认前缀</span><span><i class=\"endpoint-key\"></i>当前端点</span></div></section>\n<section class=\"sequence-section\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><span>当前连续段</span><span class=\"muted\" id=\"segmentLabel\"></span></div><div class=\"sequence\" id=\"sequence\"></div><div class=\"bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"fill\" id=\"fill\"></div></div><div class=\"lengths\"><span>当前长度<strong class=\"length-value\" id=\"currentLength\">0</strong></span><span>历史最长<strong class=\"length-value\" id=\"bestLength\">0</strong></span></div><div class=\"best-summary\">最长记录: <span class=\"mono\" id=\"bestSequence\">尚未开始</span></div></section>\n<div class=\"scan-line\"><span id=\"scanLabel\"></span><span class=\"step-count\" id=\"stepCount\"></span></div><p class=\"status\" id=\"status\"></p><div class=\"hint\">先判断 x - 1 是否存在, 只从没有前驱的起点向右查找. 哈希查询平均 O(1), 总时间期望 O(n), 空间 O(n).</div>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst values=[100,4,200,1,3,2], lookup=new Set(values), frames=[];\nlet best=0;\nfor(const x of lookup){\n if(lookup.has(x-1)){frames.push({x,sequence:[],best,text:(x-1)+' 已存在, '+x+' 不是起点, 直接跳过.'});continue}\n const sequence=[x];best=Math.max(best,1);\n frames.push({x,sequence:[...sequence],best,text:(x-1)+' 不存在, 从 '+x+' 开始扩展.'});\n let y=x+1;\n while(lookup.has(y)){sequence.push(y);best=Math.max(best,sequence.length);frames.push({x,y,sequence:[...sequence],best,text:'找到 '+y+', 当前连续长度为 '+sequence.length+'.'});y++}\n frames.push({x,sequence:[...sequence],best,text:y+' 不存在, 本段结束. 继续检查剩余集合元素.'});\n}\nframes.push({x:null,sequence:[1,2,3,4],best,text:'已检查所有集合元素, 最长连续长度为 4.'});\nconst bestSequences=[];\nlet longest=[];\nframes.forEach(f=>{if(f.sequence.length>longest.length)longest=[...f.sequence];bestSequences.push([...longest])});\nconst setBox=document.getElementById('set'), sequenceBox=document.getElementById('sequence');\nvalues.forEach(v=>{const e=document.createElement('div');e.className='num';e.textContent=v;e.dataset.v=v;setBox.appendChild(e)});\nlet index=0, displayedSequence=[];\nfunction renderSequence(sequence,origin,endpoint){\n let shared=0;\n while(shared<displayedSequence.length&&shared<sequence.length&&displayedSequence[shared]===sequence[shared])shared++;\n if(!displayedSequence.length)sequenceBox.replaceChildren();\n while(sequenceBox.children.length>shared)sequenceBox.lastElementChild.remove();\n sequence.slice(shared).forEach((v,i)=>{\n  const position=shared+i, item=document.createElement('span');item.className='sequence-item entering';\n  if(position){const arrow=document.createElement('span');arrow.className='arrow';arrow.textContent='→';arrow.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');item.appendChild(arrow)}\n  const num=document.createElement('span');num.className='num';num.dataset.v=v;num.textContent=v;item.appendChild(num);sequenceBox.appendChild(item);\n });\n if(!sequence.length){const empty=document.createElement('span');empty.className='empty';empty.textContent='本步不扩展连续段';sequenceBox.appendChild(empty)}\n [...sequenceBox.querySelectorAll('.num')].forEach(e=>{const value=+e.dataset.v;e.className='num confirmed';if(value===origin)e.classList.add('origin');if(value===endpoint)e.classList.add('endpoint')});\n displayedSequence=[...sequence];\n}\nfunction render(){const f=frames[index],endpoint=f.y??f.sequence.at(-1),origin=f.x??f.sequence[0];\n [...setBox.children].forEach(e=>{const value=+e.dataset.v;e.className='num';if(f.sequence.includes(value))e.classList.add('confirmed');if(f.sequence.length&&value===origin)e.classList.add('origin');if(value===endpoint)e.classList.add('endpoint');if(!f.sequence.length&&value===f.x)e.classList.add('scan')});\n renderSequence(f.sequence,origin,endpoint);\n document.getElementById('segmentLabel').textContent=f.sequence.length?'起点 x = '+origin:'本步跳过';\n document.getElementById('scanLabel').textContent=f.x===null?'扫描完成':'检查 x = '+f.x;\n document.getElementById('stepCount').textContent='步骤 '+(index+1)+' / '+frames.length;\n document.getElementById('status').textContent=f.text;\n document.getElementById('currentLength').textContent=f.sequence.length;\n document.getElementById('bestLength').textContent=f.best;\n document.getElementById('bestSequence').textContent=bestSequences[index].join(' → ');\n document.getElementById('fill').style.width=(f.sequence.length/4*100)+'%';\n index=(index+1)%frames.length;\n}\nrender();setInterval(render,1600);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": "",
  "time_complexity": "O(n), 期望",
  "space_complexity": "O(n)",
  "complexity_note": "n 为输入数组长度. 哈希集合查询按平均 O(1) 计; 只从无前驱的起点扩展, 每个数字参与常数次判断. 冲突退化时最坏时间 O(n²)."
}
